  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Lead your aces early (the 'Volle') to secure 11 points before they get trumped. Since you must trump if void, long suits are dangerous for opponents.\n\nTrump Management: With 4 Jacks and 7 Heart trumps (11 total), the trump distribution is key. If you have J♣ and J♠, you control the game. Draw out opponents' trumps before playing your 10s.\n\nThe 'Schmieren' (Smearing): If your partner is winning a trick, throw your 10 or Ace on it. This adds 10 or 11 points to your pile instantly. Knowing when to smear vs when to hold an Ace for a later trick is the mark of an expert.",
    Player: "Lead your aces early (the 'Volle') to secure 11 points before they get trumped. Since you must trump if void, long suits are dangerous for opponents.\n\nTrump Management: With 4 Jacks and 7 Heart trumps (11 total), the trump distribution is key. If you have J♣ and J♠, you control the game. Draw out opponents' trumps before playing your 10s.\n\nThe 'Schmieren' (Smearing): If your partner is winning a trick, throw your 10 or Ace on it. This adds 10 or 11 points to your pile instantly. Knowing when to smear vs when to hold an Ace for a later trick is the mark of an expert.",
